# Export list of the AppMgrService SA library (SA 501).
#
# libappms.z.so is loaded only by sa_main in the foundation process, and no
# image binary links against it, so the only symbols that must stay global
# are:
#   - the SA singleton statics, the same set the build system keeps for
#     shlib_type = "sa" libraries (build/templates/cxx/singleton.versionscript),
#     so that DelayedSingleton/Singleton instances stay process wide;
#   - the CFI entry points;
#   - the symbols resolved from this library by its build level consumers,
#     i.e. the ability_runtime TDD, fuzz and module tests, which link it
#     instead of recompiling the AppMgrService sources.
#
# Everything else is kept local. When a test starts using another symbol of
# this library, add it here, otherwise linking that test fails with
# "error: undefined symbol".

